{"quest_id": 6326, "name": "都に忍ぶ影", "description": "都を襲う忍者の軍団。\n忍び寄る敵の動きを見極め、\n帝都の騒乱を鎮めよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "帝都を揺らす重装砲軍", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920101, "map_no": 5270, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "exp": 250, "gold": 1000, "drops": [{"card": 237, "c": 1}, {"card": 204, "c": 1}, {"card": 59, "c": 1}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 2}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["忍者"], "hp": 4500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 47, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 110, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098896, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 436, "global_id": 435, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 43, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 30, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 57, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098800, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 17, "missile": {"speed": 5.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 122, "global_id": 121, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["忍者"], "hp": 900, "attack": 190, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 190, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 30, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 57, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100032, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 17, "missile": {"speed": 5.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 212, "global_id": 211, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 41}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 4000, "attack": 750, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 47, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 110, "move_speed": 550.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098832, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 124, "global_id": 123, "spawn_sec": 123}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ケイティ", "text": "さぁ、追い詰めましたよ。\n大人しく爆発物を渡しなさい。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "忍者", "text": "……断る。", "face": "u147"}, {"name": "カゲロウ", "text": "解せんな。なぜ忍が帝国の騒乱に手を貸す？", "face": "u139"}, {"name": "忍者", "text": "そちらこそ、なぜ体制側の肩を持つのだ？\n……それと、周りを見てみるがいい。", "face": "u147"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――ッ！？\n建物の周りに多数の忍者が！", "face": "lbd47455882a3"}, {"name": "ユリアン", "text": "チッ、囲まれたか。\nお前は俺たちを罠に誘い込むおとりだったってわけだな。", "face": "u7"}, {"name": "忍者", "text": "ふふふ、気づくのが遅かったな。\n……皆の者、かかれッ！", "face": "u147"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "忍者", "text": "くっ、抜かったか。\nだが、我らに与えられた任は果たせたはず……。", "face": "u147"}, {"name": "カゲロウ", "text": "任？　なんのことだ？\nぬしらは誰かに雇われているのか？", "face": "u139"}, {"name": "フリーデ", "text": "――おーい、忍者さんたちー！\nもうお役目は済んだから撤退していいよー！", "face": "u1566"}, {"name": "ルーテ", "text": "フリーデさん！？", "face": "u529"}, {"name": "忍者", "text": "おお、フリーデ殿！\n首尾よく要所の砦を落とせたのですな。", "face": "u147"}, {"name": "フリーデ", "text": "ああ。あんたたちがソイツらを\n引きつけてくれてた間にね。ありがとなっ！", "face": "u1566"}, {"name": "ルーテ", "text": "要所の砦が、陥落した……？", "face": "u529"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "どうやら私たちは、敵の陽動作戦に\n引っかかってしまったようですね……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "フリーデ", "text": "そんじゃ、あたしは砦に向かうから。\nじゃーな、忍者さんたち！", "face": "u1566"}, {"name": "ルーテ", "text": "お待ち下さい、フリーデさん！", "face": "u529"}, {"name": "フリーデ", "text": "……ん、誰だっけあんた？\nこんな可愛い子、知り合いにいたかな？", "face": "u1566"}, {"name": "ルーテ", "text": "直接の面識は……なんてことはともかく、\n帝国に忠誠を誓った兵である貴方たちが、なぜ……。", "face": "u529"}, {"name": "フリーデ", "text": "……仕方ないだろ、そう命じられたんだから。\nあの御方にあたしが逆らえるわけないし……。", "face": "u1566"}, {"name": "ルーテ", "text": "あ……待って、フリーデさん！", "face": "u529"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……とにかく、私たちも砦に向かいましょう！\n彼女の話が本当なら、奪われた砦を奪還しなくては！", "face": "lbd47455882a3"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920101_5270", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 481, "y": 357}, {"k": "m", "x": 95, "y": 130, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 93, "y": 280, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 91, "y": 428, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 180, "y": 132, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 179, "y": 279, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 178, "y": 428, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 260, "y": 175, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 259, "y": 293, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 260, "y": 428, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 374, "y": 427, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 382, "y": 174, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 561, "y": 176, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 584, "y": 427, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 696, "y": 429, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 692, "y": 294, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 689, "y": 176, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 804, "y": 430, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 481, "y": 427, "id": 217}, {"k": "r", "x": 176, "y": 206, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 175, "y": 356, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 581, "y": 262, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 347, "y": 260, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 765, "y": 355, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 710, "y": 505, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 412, "y": 84, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 550, "y": 84, "id": 307}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "Shadows Lurking in the Capital", "description_en": "A Ninja army attacks the capital. Read the movements of the approaching enemies and quell the turmoil in the Imperial Capital! Advanced (★1 acquisition guide: Avg Lv10)"}